{"architectures":["x64","x86"],"id":"MullvadVPN.MullvadBrowser","latestVersion":"16.0","media":{"icons":[],"screenshots":[]},"package":{"description":"Mullvad Browser is a privacy-focused web browser developed in collaboration between Mullvad VPN and the Tor Project. It's produced to minimize tracking and fingerprinting.","license":"MPL-2.0","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/mullvad/mullvad-browser/blob/14.0.7/LICENSE","locale":"en-US","localizations":{"en-US":{"description":"Mullvad Browser is a privacy-focused web browser developed in collaboration between Mullvad VPN and the Tor Project. It's produced to minimize tracking and fingerprinting.","license":"MPL-2.0","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/mullvad/mullvad-browser/blob/14.0.7/LICENSE","locale":"en-US","longDescription":"When you visit a website, you can be identified and tracked through your IP address, third-party cookies, all kinds of tracking scripts, and through so called browser fingerprints. That’s why masking your IP address is not enough to stop the data collection. However, by using a trustworthy VPN in combination with a privacy-focused browser, you can put up a better resistance against the mass surveillance of today. That's why we partnered with the Tor Project to develop Mullvad Browser – a browser designed to minimize tracking and fingerprints.","name":"Mullvad Browser","packageUrl":"https://mullvad.net/browser","publisher":"Mullvad VPN","publisherUrl":"https://mullvad.net/","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/mullvad/mullvad-browser/releases/tag/16.0","tags":["browser","gecko","internet","privacy","web","webpage"]},"zh-CN":{"description":"Mullvad 浏览器是一款注重隐私保护的网络浏览器，由 Mullvad VPN 与 Tor Project 联合开发。它可以最大程度地减少跟踪和指纹收集。","locale":"zh-CN","longDescription":"当您访问网站时，可以通过您的 IP 地址、第三方 Cookie、各种跟踪脚本以及所谓的浏览器指纹来识别和跟踪您。这就是隐藏您的 IP 地址并不足以停止数据收集的原因。不过，将值得信赖的 VPN 与注重隐私的浏览器相结合，可以更好地抵御当今的大规模监控。这就是我们与 Tor Project 合作开发 Mullvad 浏览器的原因，这款浏览器旨在最大限度地减少跟踪和指纹。","packageUrl":"https://mullvad.net/zh-hans/browser","publisherUrl":"https://mullvad.net/zh-hans","tags":["互联网","浏览器","网页","隐私"]}},"longDescription":"When you visit a website, you can be identified and tracked through your IP address, third-party cookies, all kinds of tracking scripts, and through so called browser fingerprints. That’s why masking your IP address is not enough to stop the data collection. However, by using a trustworthy VPN in combination with a privacy-focused browser, you can put up a better resistance against the mass surveillance of today. That's why we partnered with the Tor Project to develop Mullvad Browser – a browser designed to minimize tracking and fingerprints.","name":"Mullvad Browser","packageUrl":"https://mullvad.net/browser","publisher":"Mullvad VPN","publisherUrl":"https://mullvad.net/","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/mullvad/mullvad-browser/releases/tag/16.0","tags":["browser","gecko","internet","privacy","web","webpage"]},"schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","versions":[{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/16.0/app.json","detailSha256":"1ea00613d3549fafc5b71317801eb6d3e73f4f833d31ef7ea106c1bb93341464","releaseDate":"2026-10-29","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"16.0"},{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/15.0.26/app.json","detailSha256":"08eb47eaf2dcf90b71b902b095d6ef2fb613359fc5b5a26fafc0d5b75e2551b3","releaseDate":"2026-10-21","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"15.0.26"},{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/15.0.25/app.json","detailSha256":"31afb11aaaf0524aaeac1ed22c89d897227498d776d6e7d9735fa91953403a63","releaseDate":"2026-10-14","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"15.0.25"},{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/15.0.24/app.json","detailSha256":"48fe1564a6d88edb5fd085dd05320f40239d643e138d74b09248616abbb5bb1d","releaseDate":"2026-09-30","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"15.0.24"},{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/15.0.23/app.json","detailSha256":"61117a285dd484fa8fb46c57e4bf3c93c9fd2e57323ac0ebd8